<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
      Distribution entitlements for Developer ID + Hardened Runtime (NOT sandboxed).
      App Sandbox is intentionally OFF for this direct-distribution build.
      A Store edition needs explicit user-selected folder access, persistent
      security-scoped bookmarks and a per-feature sandbox audit. Sandboxing
      does not categorically prohibit file-management apps. External tool
      actions currently remain disabled pending validated adapters.
      Full Disk Access is granted by the user in
      System Settings > Privacy & Security; it is not an entitlement.

      Hardened runtime is required for notarization. We keep entitlements empty:
      spawning separate processes (docker/brew/xcrun) does not require any
      hardened-runtime exception, and we load no third-party plugins.
    -->
</dict>
</plist>
